  M4 CANDIDATE [D-talk-request gen_px5sn6j turns=10 naturalEnd=true]:
    NPC: "Never mind the food I needed — we got it handled. Thanks anyway."
    YOU: "Can I ask you something else?"
    NPC: "Anyway — that's my problem, not yours. What did you want?"
    YOU: "You said something odd the other day. Let's talk about it."
    NARR: The easy manner evaporates. What's left is watching you back.
    NARR: *Last time, they came at you for asking. That's not innocence talking. Hold your ground.*
    YOU: "I need to ask you something."
    NPC: "Nope. No." Anna shakes their head too fast. "I don't know where you're getting this."
    YOU: "Can I ask you something else?"
    NPC: "Look, forget it. You wanted something?"
    YOU: "You said something odd the other day. Let's talk about it."
    NARR: Something crosses their face — quick, then gone. The practiced expression clicks back into place.
    NARR: *They've deflected you before. The evidence needs to be heavier this time — one more thread before you speak.*
    YOU: "I need to ask you something."
    NPC: "Ha. Funny." The laugh is dry. "Is this what we're doing now? Interrogations?"
    YOU: "Can I ask you something else?"
    NPC: "That can wait — it isn't going anywhere. What's on your mind?"
    YOU: "You said something odd the other day. Let's talk about it."
    NARR: They glance toward the fire, toward the others — checking who's listening.
    NARR: *They deflected you last time, and what you have hasn't grown since. One more thread before you speak, or they'll slip away again.*
    YOU: "I need to ask you something."
    NPC: "I wasn't a surgeon. I was a hotel housekeeper. Everyone out here is selling something. I was selling a better version of me."
    YOU: "Can I ask you something else?"
    NPC: "Forget I said anything. What did you want?"
    YOU: "The show — did you see it?"
    NPC: "They took you — Sweet Tooth, on the screens. The whole fire watched. Nobody knew where to look."
    YOU: "Want to come with us?"
    NPC: "I can't. Not today. Ask me when the work's done."
    YOU: "Want to come with us?"
    NPC: "Alright. But I'm not carrying your stuff."
    NPC: "Okay. We'll pick this up later."
    NPC: They nod, already turning away.

